    <string name="instructions1">1. UBUSOBANURO BWA APULIKASIYO</string>
    <string name="instructions1_content">Iyi Apulikasiyo yitwa "ACTION DRIVING SCHOOL" ni apulikasiyo yigisha amategeko y\'umuhanda, igizwe n\ibibazo babaza mu kizamini cya porovisoiri (Uruhushya rw\'agateganyo)</string>
    <string name="instructions2">2. UKO APULIKASIYO IKORA</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_1">1. Kugirango ukoreshe iyi apulikasiyo ugomba kubanza kwiyandikisha kuri apulikasiyo mugihe ukoze download bwa mbere aho usabwa kwandika amazina na nimero ya telefone yawe.</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_2">2. Mugihe usanzwe wariyandikishije ntabwo wongera kwiyandikisha ahubwo ukanda ahanditse injira ugashyuramo nimweo ya telefone ubundi ugakanda "Emeza" ugahita ugera ahitwa dashboard usanga ibikubiyemo muri apulikasiyo.</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_3">3. Gutangira kwiga ukanda ahanditse "Ibizamini" iyo uhafunguye hagizwe n\'ibizamini 21 buri kizamini kigizwe nibibabazo 20, ariko ikizamini cya mbere ni "Ubuntu" ibindi bisaba kwishyura.</string>
    <string name="instructions2_content_4">4. Iyo uri kwitoza muri iyi application ukanda mu gisubizo mu mugambo. Iyo ugikoze gihinduka icyatsi, naho iyo icyishe gihinduka umutuku kuko ari ukwitoza, uhita ubona igisubizo cy’ukuri warangiza, ugakanda ‘next’ ukaiya kukindi kibazo. Iyo ugeze ku cyanyuma, ukanda ‘soza kizamini’, igahita ubona amanota ugize, ugahita ukanda ahanditse ‘home’ ukaiya guhitamo indi exam wiga.</string>

    <string name="instructions3">3. UKO UZASANGA IBIMINI KURI MASHINE BIMEZE</string>
    <string name="instructions_3_conten_1">Nugera mu Kizamini cya porovisoiri kuri mashine uzasanga ibi bibazo biri muri apulikasiyo  ari nako bimeze mu kizaminini nta kibazo bazakubaza muri mu kizamini cya porovisoiri kitari hano muri apulikasiyo, Muguhihtamo igisubizo uzakanda mu (✔️) ugakomeza kukindi kibazo  ukande ahanditse *Next* ukomeze n\'ibindi bibazo. Iyo usoje ubirangije uzakanda ahanditse "Soza ikizamini" uzahita umenya amanota ugize ako kanya ushatse wanagenzura ibyo wishe nibyo wakoze  nkuko bimeze muri iyi apulikasiyo</string>

    <string name="instructions4">4. KWISHURA KUGIRANGO IBIZAMINI BYOSE BIFUNGUKE</string>
    <string name="instructions4_content_1">1. Nkuko nabisobanuye haruguru ikizamini cya mbere ni ubuntu ibindi 20 bisaba kwishyura 5000 RWF kuri 0785460748 cyangwa kuri MoNo Pay: 644209 ibaruye Kuri Alexis.</string>
    <string name="instructions4_content_2">2. Iyo umaze kwishyura usubira inyuma ugategereza iminota 5 ukongera ukajya ku bizamini usanga ibyo wishyuriye byafungutse ahari akagufuri gafunze kumutuku usanga kabaye akagufuri gafunguye mu ibara ry\'icyatsi. NB: ubikora ufite connection (Internet).</string>

    <string name="instructions_4_content_3">3. Muri apulikasiyo ushobora kwishyura make ikizamini 1 ni 100 Rwf kigafunguka umunsi 1, iyo wishyuye 1000 RWF tugufungurira ibizamini 10 bikamara iminsi 10, iyo wishyuye 2000 RWF tugufungurira ibizamin byose bikamara iminsi 25, iyo wishyuye 5000 tugufungurira ibizamini byose muri apulikasiyo kugera utsinze. </string>
